<title>UK: SBC says to buy Dillon Read for $600 mln.</title>
<headline>SBC says to buy Dillon Read for $600 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp said on Thursday it had reached agreement with Dillon Read to buy the U.S. investment bank for approximately $600 million.</p>
<p>The Swiss banking giant said in a statement that upon completion of the deal, which is subject to approval by the U.S. Federal Reserve and other regulators, Dillon Read would be merged with SBC Warburg, SBC's investment banking and capital markets division, and the combined entity would be known as SBC Warburg Dillon Read.</p>
</text>
